TITLE Si species count, water pH7, 150C, eq with chrysotile and talc
SOLUTION 1
    temp 150
    pH 7 charge
    units mol/kgw
    -water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Chrysotile 0 10
    Talc       0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file si_selected.txt
    -molalities H4SiO4 H3SiO4- H2SiO4-2
    -activities H4SiO4 H3SiO4- H2SiO4-2
    -totals Si
    -pH true
    -temperature true
    -reset false
END
